<title>USA: Crown Pacific to sell Oregon plant.</title>
<headline>Crown Pacific to sell Oregon plant.</headline>
<dateline>PORTLAND, Ore. 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Crown Pacific Partners LP on Tuesday said it has signed a letter of intent to sell its remanufacturing facility and related inventories at Redmond, Oregon to Bright Wood Corp.</p>
<p>The sale price is roughly $2.5 million, plus an amount for inventories that has yet to be determined.</p>
<p>The transaction is expected to close on or before April 1, 1997.</p>
</text>
